  "goodToKnow": "Das Gewässer is a body of water: a lake, river, pond or sea. It's common in official and environmental language: Gewässerschutz (water protection), stehende und fließende Gewässer (standing and flowing waters), in deutschen Gewässern (in German waters). The prefix ge- groups things together, as in das Gebirge (mountains) and das Gebüsch (bushes). In risky waters is in unbekannten Gewässern, also figurative. Plural: die Gewässer."
